    "excluded_routes": "10.0.0.0/8, 100.64.0.0/10, 127.0.0.0/8, 169.254.0.0/16, 172.16.0.0/12, 192.0.0.0/24, 192.0.2.0/24, 192.88.99.0/24, 192.168.0.0/16, 198.51.100.0/24, 203.0.113.0/24, 224.0.0.0/4, 255.255.255.255/32",
    "fallback_udp_policy": "reject",
    "udp_drop_list": "443",
    "_loon_authority": "原则：与 Loon 冲突时一律以 Loon 为准。已据此修正 fallback_udp_policy(reject，Loon udp-fallback-mode=REJECT) 与 server_check_timeout(2000ms，Loon test-timeout=2s)。server_check_url/network_check_url 亦取自 Loon proxy-test-url/internet-test-url。",
    "_dns_exclusion_note": "dns_exclusion_list 来自 fmz（Loon 无对应概念），属纯新增：这些域名不使用 fake-ip。excluded_routes 以 Loon bypass-tun 为准；fmz 额外加的 239.255.255.250/32 已被 Loon 的 224.0.0.0/4 覆盖，属冗余，已移除。"
  },
